WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Exhaust valve spring
What it does: Returns the exhaust valve to its seat and maintains cam following.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Exhaust valve spring
How it works: The retainer compresses the spring.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Exhaust valve spring
How it moves: Shortens during opening and returns to its installed length during closing.
